  "bodyHash": "695e7dd69334e7a4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/328/mod-info.png\" alt=\"info\" width=\"1024\" height=\"107\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">歡迎來到這個模組（法老的遺產）</span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">本模組以古埃及時期／埃及法老時代為背景。</span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">想在主世界擁有沙漠生態域嗎？下載：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mysticrift-pharaohs-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span></span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">公元前 3100 年</span></h2>\n<h2>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">本模組為您的 Minecraft 伺服器增添了一個廣袤的沙漠維度。沉浸於對往昔歲月的執著之中！</span></h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">傳送門外觀：</span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/900/235/portal.png\" alt=\"portal\" width=\"1899\" height=\"958\"></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">啟動傳送門所需物品：</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/547/minecraft-forge_-1.png\" alt=\"recept\" width=\"1038\" height=\"276\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意！下載此模組前請備份您的 Minecraft 伺服器。我們不希望您的伺服器因大型生態域模組而損壞。</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">請注意：如遇崩潰或錯誤，請在 GitHub（Issues）上回報&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">注意：建立新伺服器時，載入世界後建築物可能會相互重疊生成&nbsp;</span></h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">小貼士：小心陷阱 ;)</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/330/biome.png\" alt=\"sounds\" width=\"1024\" height=\"85\"></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">誰不喜歡寧靜的生態域背景音呢？&nbsp;我們為該生態域加入了真實音效，讓微風拂過耳畔！</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/331/skywater.png\" alt=\"sky /water\" width=\"1024\" height=\"93\"></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">水與天空的顏色將與現實中的埃及保持一致！</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/326/line.png\" alt=\"line\" width=\"1024\" height=\"57\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/335/structure.png\" alt=\"structure\" width=\"1024\" height=\"149\"></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">我們已在該生態域中添加了多座建築，如神廟、獅身人面像、小型金字塔等！請查看圖片以獲取更清晰的視覺效果。</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/340/spnix.png\" alt=\"spinix\" width=\"1552\" height=\"873\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/343/temple.png\" alt=\"temple\" width=\"1418\" height=\"805\"></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">此生態域會生成多種 Minecraft 結構，包括林地府邸、金字塔、村莊等。</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/886/329/szhld8n.jpg\" alt=\"mob\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/904/291/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\">本模組使用 IntelliJ 開發</span></h1>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
